description:
Each character on this list appears in at least one Harry Potter-related work of fiction by J. K. Rowling, including:the seven original Harry Potter novels (1997–2007);
Fantastic Beasts and Where to Find Them (2001);
Quidditch Through the Ages (2001);
The Tales of Beedle the Bard (2008);
Harry Potter and the Cursed Child (2016);
Short Stories from Hogwarts of Power, Politics and Pesky Poltergeists (2016);
Short Stories from Hogwarts of Heroism, Hardship and Dangerous Hobbies (2016);
Hogwarts: An Incomplete and Unreliable Guide (2016); and
the Harry Potter prequel (2008).

